Generate {{ num_docs }} realistic English customer support ticket excerpts following these rules.

## Rules
- Each ticket must be independent with different customers and issues
- Mark PII entities with the following XML tags:
  - <PERSON>full name</PERSON>
  - <ADDRESS>full mailing address</ADDRESS>
  - <ORGANIZATION>company or institution name</ORGANIZATION>
  - <DATE_OF_BIRTH>date of birth</DATE_OF_BIRTH> (only when applicable)
  - <BANK_ACCOUNT>bank account information</BANK_ACCOUNT> (only when applicable)
- Text outside tags must be natural English prose
- Include both customer messages and agent responses
- Mix name formats: first-last, with middle initials, with titles
- Addresses should include street, city, state/province, postal code
- Each ticket should be 100-300 words

## Output format
Separate each ticket with `---DOC_SEPARATOR---`

## Topic examples
- Billing dispute with refund to bank account, shipping address change request, account verification requiring date of birth, product return with company warehouse address, service cancellation with account holder verification